### 최소 요청: 성별 공통 / 일상 외출 / 최대 3벌
POST http://localhost:8080/api/outfits/recommend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 24,
  "humidity": 65
}

### 여성복 / 원피스·올인원 선호 / 일교차: 겉옷은 CARRY로 반환
POST http://localhost:8080/api/outfits/recommend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 24,
  "humidity": 65,
  "windSpeed": 2,
  "sky": "SUNNY",
  "precipitation": "NONE",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "occasion": "DAILY",
  "preference": "ONE_PIECE",
  "thermalPreference": "NORMAL",
  "minTemperature": 14,
  "maxTemperature": 26,
  "count": 3,
  "seed": 0
}

### 비 오는 더운 날 / 남성복 / 바지(반바지 포함)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/outfits/recommend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 28,
  "humidity": 85,
  "windSpeed": 3,
  "sky": "CLOUDY",
  "precipitation": "RAIN",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "preference": "PANTS"
}

### 추운 날 운동
POST http://localhost:8080/api/outfits/recommend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": -3,
  "humidity": 50,
  "windSpeed": 5,
  "gender": "UNISEX",
  "occasion": "EXERCISE",
  "preference": "PANTS"
}

### 홈웨어: temperature에 실내 온도를 넣습니다.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/outfits/recommend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 24,
  "humidity": 50,
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "occasion": "HOME"
}

### 의류 전체 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/api/outfits/catalog

### 오류 확인: 습도 범위 초과 -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/outfits/recommend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 24,
  "humidity": 130
}

### 오늘의 시간별 의상 추천 - 지역명만 입력
GET http://localhost:8080/api/outfits/today?regionName=서울특별시 영등포구 신길제1동
